{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_06",
  "title": "骷髏之舞",
  "storyCode": "LE-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1464d7272bc1ab7b8ec25a557e8324ea355da97a606148690fb68e9c476e0b33",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g12_sewer"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩人在幽暗而寬闊的下水道裡前行。\n水聲聒噪，卻比純粹的寂靜更讓人覺得陰氣森森。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別往前走了，這裡右拐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很熟啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當然熟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "密探的基本功？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "基本中的基本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你在夕照區已經幹了很多年了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想套近乎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是好奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是保密事項。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼不走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那邊有什麼東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別想靠這種老掉牙的把戲脫身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是——你看那邊，有東西在動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "別格勒用手中的武器抵住烏提卡伯爵的後心，然後朝伯爵手指的方向看去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是源石蟲而已。源石蟲你都沒見過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的......只是源石蟲嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "堂堂烏提卡伯爵，居然被源石蟲嚇得走不動路，我也算是長見識了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是覺得有點不對勁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別傻了，趕緊走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個源石蟲的數量......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這絕對不正常！會出大事的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跑起來！快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你幹什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經要來不及了！趕快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "別格勒緊緊抓著黑鍵的手腕，兩人在下水道裡飛跑起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼、呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你腦子裡是裝了下水道的地圖嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有時間跟我陰陽怪氣，還不如多喘幾口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是陰、陰陽怪氣，我是真覺得每條岔路長得都一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "休息好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "才——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接著跑！跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（喘息聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......不行了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，我們也找到了該找的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上好，拉赫曼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上好，別格勒店長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "店長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，您自己什麼都不知道，又什麼都想摻和一腳，真是麻煩死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說是吧，別格勒店長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你才是現在最大的麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的源石蟲顯然受到了你的刺激，正在往地面上湧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你我都知道，下水道裡的源石蟲會散發有毒的臭氣，你在做的事情對夕照區的感染者來說無異於一場毒氣襲擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毒氣襲擊？可我們兩個不是好好的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種氣體對感染者的效果比對你強多了，烏提卡伯爵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說，車爾尼、芙蓉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊也......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好，你已經明白情況了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉赫曼，馬上安撫這些源石蟲，讓它們恢復原狀，否則我有權直接將你擊斃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個人可以輕輕鬆鬆引發火災，但你就算把刀架在他脖子上，也不可能讓他獨自把大火撲滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣做對你們有什麼好處？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好處？您連這點事都不明白嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別跟我打啞謎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“蟲自陰暗中湧出，肆意噴吐毀滅的前奏。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還需要我一個詞一個詞地幫您解釋嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以說，讓那個預言成真，對你們有什麼好處？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就不勞您費心了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想幹什麼？滅口？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是擊昏他，我親愛的眼神不好的密探先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有控制源石蟲的辦法嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我有，就不用跟他廢話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們趕緊走，晚了就怕來不及了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（銳利的眼神）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人不可貌相啊，烏提卡伯爵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行，我去把他背起來，你跟著我跑出去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，那個是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "順著別格勒的視線，黑鍵也看到了。\n拉赫曼倒下的地方，下水道的牆壁上，有什麼銀色的東西正閃著光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是鑰匙孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "裡面也許是驅動源石蟲的什麼裝置！我來把門轟開——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先讓我試試能不能把鎖撬開吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萬一你轟壞了什麼重要的東西，那就糟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能打開嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這鎖很難開，但還難不倒我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你能不能趁開鎖時行行好，告訴我，預言的內容究竟是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒聽過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......算了，反正已經傳開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "越過高高的山崗，惡魔踏入黃昏的中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血中的惡疾隱伏，款款招來蔓延的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蟲自陰暗中湧出，肆意噴吐毀滅的前奏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終曲的合奏消散，災禍帶走最後的陽光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......合奏......災禍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實話，我到現在都很好奇最後一句是什麼意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面都已經很明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一句是羅德島的芙蓉來到夕照區，第二句是假癒現象蔓延......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你連這個都知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為密探的工作是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在第三句也明白了，差的就只有最後一句——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實驗室？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g5_czernyhome"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，是你啊。主持工作辛苦你了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生，外面現在已經亂成一鍋粥了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下水道裡冒出了一波又一波散發臭氣的源石蟲，好多人中了毒，街上已經全亂套了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好多人都把這當成預言的一部分，現在夕照區已經人心惶惶了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會有這種事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人心惶惶先不論，那些被熏倒的人情況怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是很樂觀......尤其是最近礦石病有好轉的那些人，反應都很劇烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已經在聯繫醫院了，但那些醫院的接線員一聽說是夕照區的事，都不是很積極......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不積極？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這就出門去和那些醫院交涉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外面現在很危險，您還是打電話吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你們打的電話他們不積極，我光是打打電話也不可能有什麼用，這事必須得我本人出馬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明天就是音樂會了，如果您也中了毒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是因為這種莫名其妙的事件出現了傷亡，就算音樂會如期舉行，還能有人全心全意享受音樂嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想事情發展到那一步，更不想假裝什麼都沒發生，一邊欺騙自己，一邊強顏歡笑地彈奏哪怕一個和絃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g3_slumstreets_night"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼這麼多源石蟲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神經質的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好臭！這什麼味道啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我扶著你，我們趕緊跑吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神經質的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來......預言是真的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死的蟲子，別過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克勞澤，克勞澤！站起來——咳、咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救命！來人啊，誰來救救我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大提琴聲......源石蟲往聲音傳來的方向去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，過路人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克勞澤，起來，扶著我的肩膀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神經質的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扶著我，我們快走吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）不客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "以白堊為中心，大提琴聲沿著夕照區狹窄的街巷蔓延開去。\n琴聲所到之處，源石蟲紛紛調轉方向。\n那些被包圍的人們以為事情就此了結，噴吐毒霧的蟲豸會在琴聲的指引下回到陰暗的溝渠裡。\n但他們錯了。\n在他們看得到的地方，看不到的地方，源石蟲都朝著白堊的方向湧去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g3_slumstreets_night"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼、呼、呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終於......出來了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在......怎麼辦，直接用法術炸翻這些蟲子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又怎麼不對勁了，我親愛的密探先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石蟲在朝一個地方匯集——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大提琴聲......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊，你在做什麼？快停下——咳、咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別喊了，沒用的，對你的呼吸系統也不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫我一把，讓我過去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說了別喊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不會因為你喊就停下，我也不會因為你不喊就袖手旁觀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們兩個合力打開一條通道，往白堊的方向去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行。我會往你的反方向行進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要回你的咖啡店？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。我們合力在這裡打開一個空缺，之後就分道揚鑣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回你的咖啡店，研究那些在實驗室裡發現的破紙，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝天謝地，塵世之音的研究筆記可比源石蟲毒氣的受害者更令人感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊的事是你自己惹出來的，你自己解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再有，如果我發現那些研究筆記和計畫書裡有一筆是你寫的，你就等著吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閒話到此為止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我數到三，我們一起動手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
